{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31476","headline":"湘西寺霁夜 · 李羣玉","name":"湘西寺霁夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨过琉璃宫，佳兴浩清绝。\n松风冷晴滩，竹路踏碎月。\n月波荡如水，气爽星朗灭。\n皓夜千树寒，峥嵘万岩雪。\n後山鹤唳断，前池荷香发。\n境寂凉夜深，神思空飞越。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}